{\fs46\b\cf1 Eat Your Green - 6 Reel Scripts (Hinglish)}\par
{\fs20\cf3 Flow: Hook (0-3s) -> Retain -> Problem -> Benefit/CTA. Length about 30-34 sec each. Captions ON (most watch on mute). One CTA per reel. Prepared by Dizigroww.}\par
\par
{\fs20\cf3 How to read each beat: On-screen = the text shown on the video. Shot = what is on screen. Voiceover = say this out loud.}\par
\par\par

{\fs30\b\cf1 Video 1 - The dinner-table fight}\par
{\b Target:} Mums of fussy eaters age 2-6   {\b Product:} The Guide (Rs 399)   {\b Length:} ~32 sec   {\b Format:} Mom face-to-camera + B-roll\par
\par
{\b\cf2 HOOK (0-3s)}\par
{\b On-screen:} Roz ki sabzi ki ladai?\par
{\b Shot:} Close-up of a child turning away from the plate\par
{\b Voiceover:} Har dinner ek jung ban jaata hai? Ye 30 second sirf aapke liye.\par
\par
{\b\cf2 RETAIN (3-9s)}\par
{\b On-screen:} Main bhi yahi karti thi\par
{\b Shot:} You to camera, tired smile\par
{\b Voiceover:} Main bhi bribe karti thi, daraati thi, chammach le ke peeche bhaagti thi.\par
\par
{\b\cf2 PROBLEM (9-18s)}\par
{\b On-screen:} Push = aur zyada NAA\par
{\b Shot:} Cold food, child saying no\par
{\b Voiceover:} Par sach ye hai - jitna zor lagao, bachcha utna "nahi" karta. Pressure se sabzi dushman ban jaati hai.\par
\par
{\b\cf2 BENEFIT (18-28s)}\par
{\b On-screen:} Ek shaant tareeka\par
{\b Shot:} Calm table, child curious about a green\par
{\b Voiceover:} Eat Your Green ka gentle 4C method bina chillaaye kaam karta hai - Curiosity, Connection, Creativity, Consistency.\par
\par
{\b\cf2 CTA (28-33s)}\par
{\b On-screen:} Rs 399 - Link in bio\par
{\b Voiceover:} Sirf Rs 399, instant download. Aaj raat se shuru karo - link bio me.\par
\par
{\b Caption:} Roz ki sabzi ki ladai se thak gaye? Forcing se ulta hota hai. Ye gentle tareeka 5000+ Indian parents use kar rahe hain. Link in bio. #pickyeater #indianmoms #parentingtips #gentleparenting #momlife\par
\par\par

