{\fs30\b\cf1 Production notes}\par
{\b 1.} Hook must land in the first 2 seconds - open on the child/food or Prerna's face, never an intro.\par
{\b 2.} Keep captions large and high-contrast, placed in the top two-thirds (the Reels UI covers the bottom).\par
{\b 3.} One CTA only per reel - link in bio OR a comment keyword (GREEN / BOOK2 / START).\par
{\b 4.} Best for cold reach: Videos 1, 2, 3, 6. Best for warm/retargeting: Videos 4, 5.\par
{\b 5.} Swap in real B-roll: real dinner moments, the book/printables, a child trying a green.\par
